reduce traffic on the network backbone. So, my question: has anyone seen a
stacker for a 4mm tape drive (or for that matter, any SCSI-based tape
drive that'll serve my needs)? Any input would be appreciated, please feel
free to private email, and I'll be glad to summarize if there's any
interest. 

