Woah, there.  When will this come?  And what do you mean by English?
English words, and some stylized English sentences?  Sure.  Common,
natural English?  Don't bet on it, at least any time soon.  Heck, we
can't even get a computer to use indexicals and demonstratives the way
we do.

>#mind-numbingly cumbersome.  Who wants to type "copy" when you can type
>#"cp"?  Once you've gotten past the one day learning curve, dropping two

