"Geniuses" are not the only people who invent their own short language.
*Every* group of people develop their own codes, their own short language.
Carberateur, spark plugs and distributers contacts become carbs, points,
and plugs. Cyberpunk becomes CP. Complicated wiring becomes spaghetti.
