I have a mvax II running ultrix 4.2 with several 14.4k modems locked at
19200. I didn't configure the modems myself, but I can provide the output
from at&v if someone would like to see it. The lines in /etc/ttys read
as shown above, except I use 8bit.19200, as I didn't think zmodem would work
