on the VAXstation 3100's the on-system-board graphics controller and
memory are turned off when an SPX is added to the system.  The SPX
board then runs itself at whatever refresh rate you have.  IF the monitor
you just bought at 66Hz works with the SPX, then the vr262 will work with
the monochrome onboard graphics.  

